    {
      "id": "IZ7PuUset45FGPoGehM4b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1000.3640598617967,
      "y": 6174.918999011414,
      "width": 1397.0445246036757,
      "height": 157.50022831194804,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "EwIPGVHRg2h1wzdZQ6Xwz"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bHT",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 548384850,
      "version": 226,
      "versionNonce": 921256453,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793553727766,
      "created": 1792831308469,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "在云数据中心场景下，若租户需要新增1个VPC、若干subnet及若干虚机，\nRunOS的完整工作流是怎样的？它是如何与OpenStack或MANO等上层编排\n器配合工作的？",
      "fontSize": 42.000060883186144,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "在云数据中心场景下，若租户需要新增1个VPC、若干subnet及若干虚机，RunOS的完整工作流是怎样的？它是如何与OpenStack或MANO等上层编排器配合工作的？",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "KfLbxdCp8552wUK-cFxd8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1004.060028761131,
      "y": 6408.25267058467,
      "width": 1464.4362589518225,
      "height": 210.0003044159307,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "EwIPGVHRg2h1wzdZQ6Xwz"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bHU",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1201649102,
      "version": 207,
      "versionNonce": 2026343627,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793553727766,
      "created": 1792831308480,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "RunOS系统内部是如何记录不同VRF、IP interface以及不同subnet的节点状态\n和物理/逻辑位置的？这些信息目前是否在北向接口上开放？如果开放的话，可\n以做一个中间翻译组件将信息从SDN-DC（现网的控制器）同步给SDN-NPS\n（数字孪生网络控制器）",
      "fontSize": 42.000060883186144,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "RunOS系统内部是如何记录不同VRF、IP interface以及不同subnet的节点状态和物理/逻辑位置的？这些信息目前是否在北向接口上开放？如果开放的话，可以做一个中间翻译组件将信息从SDN-DC（现网的控制器）同步给SDN-NPS（数字孪生网络控制器）",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Y7LxWAlYimUKJU-GpMLK3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -999.1326853282758,
      "y": 6740.475501554326,
      "width": 1514.5815720861126,
      "height": 157.50022831194804,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "EwIPGVHRg2h1wzdZQ6Xwz"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bHV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1270470162,
      "version": 230,
      "versionNonce": 48019813,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793553727766,
      "created": 1792831308484,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "如果RunOS目前不具备上述功能，是否允许基于其开放的API，开发一个北向应用\n组件，专门用于记录租户场景的资源池状态，从而将这些逻辑数据同步给SDN-C-\nNPS？",
      "fontSize": 42.000060883186144,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "如果RunOS目前不具备上述功能，是否允许基于其开放的API，开发一个北向应用组件，专门用于记录租户场景的资源池状态，从而将这些逻辑数据同步给SDN-C-NPS？",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "qJv1iLOFJl0-d7L02ATsF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1003.1496409530096,
      "y": 6984.087060917762,
      "width": 1584.837569924122,
      "height": 105.00015220796536,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "EwIPGVHRg2h1wzdZQ6Xwz"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bHW",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1174653966,
      "version": 235,
      "versionNonce": 829537131,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793553727766,
      "created": 1792831308488,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "针对上述完整的工作流（云平台下发网络配置到SDN控制器并记录状态），其他主流开\n源SDN（如ONOS、ODL）是如何实现的？这方面需要提供相关的文献调研。",
      "fontSize": 42.000060883186144,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "针对上述完整的工作流（云平台下发网络配置到SDN控制器并记录状态），其他主流开源SDN（如ONOS、ODL）是如何实现的？这方面需要提供相关的文献调研。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "UClRUttQ1EO7zxshk0IA6",
      "type": "rectangle",
